    {
      "key": "gg.lv.parts",
      "title": "Gun Parts at LV",
      "tier": "LV",
      "desc": [
        "Steel guns are built from steel parts, and three of them turn up in almost every LV recipe. The Hardened Steel Barrel (a steel pipe, two rings and a plate) is the bore of the pistol and the rifle. The Iron Receiver (three iron plates, Mechanical Parts and two steel screws) is the action of the bolt-action rifle. Mechanical Parts T2 (small steel gears, springs and screws) is the clockwork inside nearly everything.",
        "All three are LV Assembler recipes, and NEI shows the inputs. Hold one of each to finish this quest.",
        "[note]Mechanical Parts T2 are also an input to empty magazines, so make extra.[/note]"
      ],
      "pre": [
