    {
      "key": "gg.lv.pistol",
      "title": "9mm Pistol",
      "tier": "LV",
      "desc": [
        "Your first real sidearm. The 9mm Pistol is semi-automatic and fed from an eighteen-round magazine, so a reload is one key press instead of the Hand Cannon's slow single shot.",
        "It is an LV Assembler recipe. The inputs are a Hardened Steel Barrel, Mechanical Parts T2, steel plates, rubber plates, steel screws and a spring: the parts from the last quest plus a little rubber, standing in for a plastic grip. NEI has the exact list.",
        "The pistol takes 9mm Pistol Magazines, filled from three bullets each; see the Magazines quest next.",
        "[note]Press Reload with a loaded magazine in your inventory. Sneak and right-click a magazine to empty it back into loose rounds.[/note]"
      ],
