      "key": "gg.lv.magazines",
      "title": "Magazines",
      "tier": "LV",
      "desc": [
        "A magazine is built in two steps in the same Ammo Press. First press empty magazines: two steel plates, eight small steel springs and Mechanical Parts T2 make eight. Then fill them: four empties and twelve 9mm bullets make four loaded magazines.",
        "You can also fill one by hand: put an empty magazine and three 9mm bullets together in a crafting grid. The press is just faster, and the pipes in the Ammo Logistics chapter can run it for you.",
        "[note]A loaded pistol magazine holds eighteen rounds. Sneak and right-click it to take the bullets back out.[/note]"
      ],
