        "It is built in the LV Assembler from an Iron Barrel, Mechanical Parts, a Wooden Stock, steel plates and screws, and a spring. Compare its damage and range with the pistol on the tooltips and keep the one you like; two Revolvers combine into Akimbo Revolvers at a crafting table.",
