      "key": "gg.lv.sawed_off",
      "title": "Sawed Off",
      "tier": "LV",
      "desc": [
        "Two barrels, two shells, and an apology to whatever is in front of you. The Sawed Off fires a spray of pellets: ruinous at point-blank range and nearly useless at a distance. It holds two shells, and a reload tops up only what you have fired.",
        "Build it in an LV Assembler from two Iron Barrels, a Wooden Stock, a steel plate, screws and a spring. Its ammo is the Shotgun Shell, which the Ammo Press makes from eight brass foils, twenty-four lead rounds and four gunpowder per batch of eight; the Ammo Logistics chapter walks through it.",
        "[warn]Do not stand in the open with it. Anything that survives the first two shells is already next to you.[/warn]"
      ],
