    {
      "key": "gg.lv.melee",
      "title": "Knife or Crowbar",
      "tier": "LV",
      "desc": [
        "Melee tools never run dry. The Combat Knife is a steel blade for when the magazine is empty; the Crowbar is a tool as much as a weapon, and it mines blocks like an iron pickaxe. Either one completes this quest, and both are cheap.",
        "Both are LV Assembler recipes. The knife takes two steel plates, a rubber plate and two screws; the crowbar takes long steel rods, a plate and a screw. Check NEI for the exact amounts.",
        "[note]A crowbar in your hotbar means one less pickaxe to carry on a bunker raid.[/note]"
      ],
      "pre": [
        "gg.lv.intro"
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "type": "retrieval",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "gregguns:combat_knife",
              "count": 1,
