      "title": "Stielgranate",
      "tier": "LV",
      "desc": [
        "A classic stick grenade: a steel head packed with gunpowder on a wooden handle. It deals heavy blast damage in a radius of about five blocks and bounces a few times before it settles, so you can throw it around a corner. Sixteen come out of one LV Assembler run.",
        "The recipe is two steel plates, four gunpowder and a wooden stick. Hold sixteen to finish the quest. Hold right click to wind up a throw; the longer you hold, the farther it goes.",
        "[warn]The fuse is ten seconds long and the blast hurts you too. Throw it and step back. By default it does not break blocks, but a server can turn that on.[/warn]"
