      "title": "Steel Age Done",
      "tier": "LV",
      "desc": [
        "You have a press, a pistol, a revolver, a shotgun, a rifle and steel armor. LV is done. The next gate is aluminum, and with it come automatic weapons, grenades with real fragments, and the first serious armor.",
        "Aluminum is a GregTech project in its own right: bauxite, electrolysis, and an MV power setup. Take your time. Everything you built here keeps working at MV, and a higher-tier machine runs lower-tier recipes faster.",
        "Hold four aluminum plates to close the chapter and take the big loot bag. Spend some of the winnings on ammo, because MV guns burn through it.",
        "[note]The MV chapter opens from the pack's MV quests, not from this one. You can start it any time.[/note]"
